WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.178
Carabas was very poor.

2
00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:13.792
His roof had holes.

3
00:00:13.793 --> 00:00:17.650
His clothes had holes.

4
00:00:17.651 --> 00:00:26.171
Even his shoes had holes.

5
00:00:26.172 --> 00:00:31.626
Each morning Carabas worked in his garden.

6
00:00:31.627 --> 00:00:34.465
"Hello, Carabas!"

7
00:00:34.466 --> 00:00:37.822
Batista walked by with his donkey.

8
00:00:37.823 --> 00:00:44.034
Carabas waved to his brother.

9
00:00:44.035 --> 00:00:47.154
Carabas checked his tomatoes.

10
00:00:47.155 --> 00:00:49.679
"Ugh!" he said.

11
00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:53.383
Bugs were eating one tomato.

12
00:00:53.384 --> 00:00:57.537
Another was rotten.

13
00:00:57.538 --> 00:01:03.375
Suddenly an apple rolled down from the road.

14
00:01:03.376 --> 00:01:05.936
Carabas picked it up.

15
00:01:05.937 --> 00:01:09.686
The apple was red and shiny.

16
00:01:09.687 --> 00:01:14.015
He licked his lips.

17
00:01:14.016 --> 00:01:20.718
Then Carabas spotted a man with an apple cart.

18
00:01:20.719 --> 00:01:24.465
He ran after the cart.

19
00:01:24.466 --> 00:01:29.522
"You dropped an apple!" Carabas said.

20
00:01:29.523 --> 00:01:38.708
The man thanked him. "You're very honest!"

21
00:01:38.709 --> 00:01:44.276
Later Carabas went into town.

22
00:01:44.277 --> 00:01:47.330
He bought a small loaf of bread.

23
00:01:47.331 --> 00:01:53.663
Suddenly he heard music!

24
00:01:53.664 --> 00:01:57.274
Carabas peeked inside a cafe.

25
00:01:57.275 --> 00:02:03.407
A man was playing a guitar.

26
00:02:03.408 --> 00:02:06.520
Carabas closed his eyes.

27
00:02:06.521 --> 00:02:10.450
"Beautiful music," he thought.

28
00:02:10.451 --> 00:02:13.923
Nearby some people were talking.

29
00:02:13.924 --> 00:02:17.331
"Did you hear the news?" a man asked.

30
00:02:17.332 --> 00:02:20.466
"An ogre came down from the hills!"

31
00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:27.146
The others gasped.

32
00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:31.240
Carabas gulped. "Where is the ogre now?"

33
00:02:31.241 --> 00:02:33.239
The man shrugged.

34
00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:37.185
"Nobody knows," he said.

35
00:02:37.186 --> 00:02:40.669
"Ogres are terrible," a woman said.

36
00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:43.327
"I'm locking my door tonight!"

37
00:02:43.328 --> 00:02:46.584
Carabas hurried home.

38
00:02:46.585 --> 00:02:52.226
He was going to lock his door too!

